{"page":200,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:80","surah":9,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"ٱسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ أَوْ لَا تَسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ إِن تَسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ سَبْعِينَ مَرَّةً فَلَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ كَفَرُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It makes no difference [Prophet] whether you ask forgiveness for them or not: God will not forgive them even if you ask seventy times, because they reject God and His Messenger. God does not guide those who rebel against Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"Ask forgiveness","transliteration":"is'taghfir","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"ask forgiveness","transliteration":"tastaghfir","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"you ask forgiveness","transliteration":"tastaghfir","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَبْعِينَ","en_gloss":"seventy","transliteration":"sabʿīna","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَرَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"times","transliteration":"marratan","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَغْفِرَ","en_gloss":"will Allah forgive","transliteration":"yaghfira","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"will Allah forgive","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:80"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"[for] them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:80"},{"